DESCRIPTION:Learn more about the teams and projects here! (https://www.rcel
	connect.org/seip/)  &#160\;ABOUT SEIP  The Rice University Summer Engineer
	ing Innovation Program (SEIP) (https://www.rcelconnect.org/seip/) is a han
	ds-on\, interdisciplinary initiative designed for engineering graduate stu
	dents to tackle real-world challenges using cutting-edge technologies: Art
	ificial Intelligence\, Digital Engineering\, Model-Based Systems Engineeri
	ng (MBSE)\, and Industry 4.0. Over the course of 10 weeks\, students gain 
	experience working in multidisciplinary teams\, collaborating with industr
	y partners\, and applying advanced tools to prototype innovative solutions
	.\n\nhttps://events.rice.edu/live/events/430602-rice-university-summer-eng
